+# AI04 OTA relay (legacy alternative)
+
+The current AI04 PT-BR overlay uses a native static manifest and does **not**
+need this Cloudflare Worker. It retains the official XiaoZhi endpoint for
+activation and connection configuration, then loads its PT-BR firmware offer
+from `CONFIG_AI04_OTA_MANIFEST_URL` without forwarding device identity to the
+release host.
+
+Keep this Worker only when a downstream deployment explicitly needs a server
+side relay. It is not part of the default installer path.
 
 The reconstructed AI04 firmware keeps the official `davinci-ai04-c3` device
 identity so XiaoZhi can supply activation, MQTT/WebSocket configuration and
